          "semantic_revision": 25,
          "provenance_revision": 25,
          "summary": "Correct OTH and IND candidate multiplicities in all 88 2022vic seat entries, using the public VEC 2022 district result candidate lists for the 87 active contests. Preserve separate Liberal/National groupings. For postponed Narracan, use the original November ballot list documented by ABC (https://www.abc.net.au/news/elections/vic/2022/guide/narr), retaining its existing exclusion of the deceased Nationals candidate and not importing January 2023 nominations. This also registers the previously unrecorded 2022vic seat configuration changes, including the separate National candidacies and incumbents used by the replay.",
