            "stages": []
          },
          "source": {
            "description": "Public VEC first-preference candidate tables for all 87 active 2022 districts; original November Narracan nominations from the ABC election guide as noted in the summary. Minor registered parties without their own model grouping count as OTH; candidates without a party endorsement count as IND. Each asterisk denotes one additional candidate.",
